+	 * lowmem framebuffer; a 32bpp XRGB8888 kernel fb (+33% fetch) makes that
+	 * TG underflow (continuous LCDC_UNDERFLOW -> black, see CHECKPOINT 17.22).
+	 * 24bpp + a lowmem CMA pool (cma=...@0x85000000 on the cmdline) reproduces
